        "articleContentType": "Magazines",
        "publicationTitle": "Annals of the History of Computing",
        "authors": [],
        "abstract": "This is only our second issue, but it is indeed a very special one. Along with an interesting article on the origins of the computer industry, we are able to bring you an annotated bibliography of the entire history of computing literature, representing many years of dedicated work by Brian Randell, surely the most complete guide to the entire field available. ",
        "keywords": {}
