        "abstract": "It certainly seems appropriate that in the first issue of this new journal involving computing history, which AFIPS is launching, there should be a description of what is also AFIPS' first major venture into a broad based spectrum of activities in the area of computing history. It is the purpose of this article to describe these AFIPS activities and plans, and simultaneously to encourage all readers to participate, either actively or supportively.",
